        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pwatson1974/{size}/1925_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-05-31T09:44:23.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It does measn reduce the damage dealt by 2, you are correct because otherwise it makes no sense as you noted.</p><p>Opposition ships are ships that aren't Strikeforce ships, so flipped ships, opposition deck ships and flagships are all opposition ships.</p><p>And yes, once the flaship shows up, you must kill it because it is an opposition ship.</p>",
