        "raw": "<p>It does mean reduce the damage dealt, but &quot;r<span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: 'PT Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">educe the amount reduced by two&quot;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">is also correct; if a ship takes five damage, you reduce its energy by 5, so reducing the amount of damage taken by two is equivalent to reducing the amount of energy reduced by two, from 5 to 3.</span></p>",
