        "created_at": "2014-05-31T14:28:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"awp832\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/a9a28c/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> awp832:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I initially assumed I can engage only once (choosing to be either a primary or secondary engager) but I am not seeing where it actually says that. &nbsp;Can I engage multiple ships? &nbsp;If myself an an allied strike force ship are in the same sector with say, 2 opposition ships, &nbsp;can I engage Opposition ship A as a Primary Engager and Opposition Ship B as a Secondary engager, while my ally engages B as a primary engager and A as a secondary engager?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Page 9, second sentence under \"Engage Event\"</p>\n<blockquote>\nA strike force ship can either engage as a primary engager or a secondary engager.\n</blockquote>\n&nbsp;\n<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"awp832\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/a9a28c/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> awp832:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;Also, can I travel to a sector that I am already in? &nbsp;This might not seem like a big deal, but I was playing Kauchar's Claw and it sort of is.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Hit and Run</p>\n<blockquote>\nKharacgar's Claw may travel to another Sector.\n</blockquote>\nDeadly Focus\n<blockquote>\nKharachar's Claw and an Opposition Ship engaged with the Karachar's Claw travel to another Sector.\n</blockquote>\nNow I don't know if you can \"travel\" to the sector you are currently in or not (I don't think you can, since the travel event says \"you may move to another sector\"), but using Karachar's Claw makes you travel to another sector. Since traveling to the same sector is not traveling to another sector.\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<blockquote>\ncan I engage as many opposition ships as I want?\n</blockquote>\nNo, Strike Force Ships can only engage with one ship.",
